From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:02:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Fill the eight light B1 targets (one-query family, SAT
 oracle, BGS separation half)

Classes: mem_POracle_of_polyTimeReducible (W1 capture onto the query tape plus
the answer tail, budget (C+2)*2^c*(n^c+1)), oracle_mem_POracle, and
compl_mem_POracle (the audit's direct emission negation).

SATOracle: compl_SAT_mem_POracle_SAT, NP_subset_POracle_SAT,
coNP_subset_POracle_SAT.

Relativization: unaryWitnessLang_mem_NPOracle (the P3.2 four-state machine,
exponent 1, constant 3) and exists_oracle_ne (the stage construction:
Classical.choose fresh lengths, import-free counting, the max cutoff,
consistency and query-set locality with the partial oracle first, domination
at i >= k + 1 + 2c).

POracle_eq_P_of_mem_P stays sorried, deferred to the oracle-call-hosting
extension; baker_gill_solovay is B5's. All existing statements are
byte-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
